# Pairs with GateOwnership. A leaked gate refuses every later split of C.
MODULE: ConsolidationKeepsGate
TARGET: GateOwnership
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: consolidation returns without releasing C's split gate
PERTURBS: ConsolidationFinish

--- FIND
    /\ cons = "holding"
    /\ gate' = [gate EXCEPT !["C"] = "free"]
--- REPLACE
    /\ cons = "holding"
    \* MUTATION: the gate is kept
    /\ gate' = gate
--- END
